    - (iv) when the bank or controlling company calculates the relevant credit exposure amount to be included in terms of the provisions of this subregulation (6), the bank or controlling company shall not apply any maturity adjustment envisaged in the Prudential Standard on Market Risk, issued by the Authority, to the said credit exposure amount;[Regulation 24(6)
