    - (iii) when the deposit insurance scheme covers only a percentage of the funds, such as ninety per cent of the deposit amount, but not one hundred per cent, up to a limit of, for example, R100 000, the bank shall classify the entire deposit of R150 000 as less stable;[Regulation 26(12)
