    - (i) a sufficiently detailed description of how the bank defines its exposure to interest rate risk in the banking book, for risk management, risk control and measurement purposes;
    - (ii) a sufficiently detailed description of the bank’s overall management and mitigation strategies related to its exposure to interest rate risk in the banking book, such as, for example—
