- (g) Business Indicator and Business Indicator Component Based upon, among others, the respective criteria, components and requirements specified in paragraph (f) read with the relevant requirements specified in this paragraph (g), a bank—
 
    - (i) shall firstly calculate the relevant required Business Indicator (BI) through the application of the formulae specified below: BI = ILDC + SC + FC
 
